<title>ITALY: Luxottica Group Q3 revenues rise.</title>
<headline>Luxottica Group Q3 revenues rise.</headline>
<dateline>AGORDO, Italy 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		    1995</p>
<p>ADS				$0.66		   $0.46</p>
<p>Net				561.6 bln lire	576.2 bln lire</p>
<p>Revs			     45 bln lire	   33.1 bln lire</p>
<p>				 9 MONTHS</p>
<p>ADS				$2.22		   $1.56</p>
<p>Net				1,832.7 bln lire    1,291.1 bln lire</p>
<p>Revs				154.4 bln lire     114.2 bln lire</p>
<p>NOTE - Results include Persol Spa, acquired during the second quarter of 1995 and LensCrafters, whose purchase was completed May 14 1995. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
